de, crossing through various colorful places until you face the evil <strong>IRONMOL-cajete</strong> (It\u2019s a robot with AI that turned pi\u00f1atas evil! Can you imagine that? An evil pi\u00f1ata? How sad\u2026).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're tired of that sadness, fix it by hitting your friend with a chair or many other things! (We say it in the game, not in real life). In <strong>Lucha Mode</strong>, up to 4 players can grab and beat each other uncontrollably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.poster.avif?t=1748542061\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.webm?t=1748542061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.mp4?t=1748542061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face evil, create a revolution, overthrow the system, eat tons of tacos, have fun, and become a LEGEND. Never forget that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.poster.avif?t=1748542061\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.webm?t=1748542061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.mp4?t=1748542061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Lucha Masters: Mighty Lucha is a fast-paced action game where up to 4 players brawl through thrilling adventures! With retro 8-bit vibes, unforgettable characters, co-op mayhem, and a spicy dose of Mexican culture, it\u2019s time to step into the ring and prove who\u2019s the real luchador!",
